 ios/

# Native projects — Continuous Native Generation (CNG).
# `expo prebuild` / EAS Build regenerate these from app.json on every build, so
# committing them means app.json's orientation/icon/plugins silently stop
# applying (expo-doctor flags exactly this). Never commit them back.
/android
/ios
